  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "B\xF6r\xFChan ota\u011Fdan \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda t\u0131ls\u0131m birden parlamaya ba\u015Flad\u0131."
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Bir y\xF6ne d\xF6nd\xFC\u011F\xFCnde parl\u0131yor, ba\u015Fka y\xF6ne gitti\u011Finde s\xF6n\xFCyordu."
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1b85c12ef309323b2bffc83efae91dcb, type: 2}
    text: "Bana yol g\xF6steriyor... I\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 takip etmeliyim."
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
